The package's R functions and interface were developed for ALS Downloader.
Treetop was consulted as an architectural reference; no Treetop source code is
included in the new package.

world-countries.geojson is generated from world-atlas 2.0.2 countries-110m.json,
https://github.com/topojson/world-atlas, derived from Natural Earth public-domain
map data (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/).
